 Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">英伟达计划发行至少200亿美元债券以扩充AI算力基础设施</span></section></section><section style=\"display:flex;margin-bottom:16px;align-items:baseline;\"><section style=\"flex-shrink:0;width:36px;text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-weight:900;color:rgb(92,11,214);font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-style:italic;line-height:1;\">04</span></section><section style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#1f1f1f;letter-spacing:.5px;line-height:1.6;text-align:justify;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">稀宇科技正式开源多模态旗舰模型 MiniMax M3，推理速度提升至 80 TPS</span></section></section><section style=\"display:flex;margin-bottom:16px;align-items:baseline;\"><section style=\"flex-shrink:0;width:36px;text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-weight:900;color:rgb(92,11,214);font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-style:italic;line-height:1;\">05</span></section><section style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#1f1f1f;letter-spacing:.5px;line-height:1.6;text-align:justify;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">字节跳动拟向天数智芯采购5万颗AI芯片，加码国产算力布局</span></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:10px auto;text-align:center;\"><section style=\"display:inline-block;\"><section style=\"margin-top:-4px;padding:0 40px;outline:0;font-size:24px;letter-spacing:1.5px;\"><strong><span leaf=\"\">新闻速览</span></strong></section><section style=\"margin-top:-2px;width:182px;height:2px;background-color:rgb(58,19,228);overflow:hidden;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></section><section style=\"margin-top:3px;width:182px;height:1px;background-color:rgb(111,19,209);overflow:hidden;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></section><section style=\"outline:0;font-size:12px;letter-spacing:1.5px;color:rgb(92,11,214);transform:scale(.9);\"><span leaf=\"\">NEWS GLANCE</span></section></section></section><section id=\"xiangqing\"><section id=\"content1\"><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">高通正洽谈以最高百亿美元收购AI芯片初创公司Tenstorrent</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/1046445a6c803cfddfb38e4cc8abc1da.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">高通公司正就收购AI芯片初创企业Tenstorrent展开深度谈判，交易对价预计在80亿至100亿美元之间。相较于Tenstorrent去年底D轮融资时约26亿美元的估值，高通给出的报价溢价数倍。Tenstorrent成立于2016年，由传奇芯片设计师Jim Keller领导，核心业务为开发用于AI模型训练与应用推理的加速器芯片。若收购达成，高通将获得Tenstorrent的顶尖架构师团队及核心技术，此举被视为高通战略版图的重要扩张，旨在大幅增强其在人工智能领域的实力，并直接切入数据中心芯片市场。目前双方谈判仍在进行中，最终金额及条款仍存在变数，不排除谈判破裂的可能。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">蚂蚁集团秘密内测AI版支付宝，推出智能体助手“阿宝”并重构界面</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/a9b22bef74e94879dd144e1df99391fd.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">蚂蚁集团正秘密内测“AI版支付宝”，代号“宝计划”，旨在推动App全面向AI Agent时代转型。新版本核心在于交互逻辑的重构，首推AI助手“阿宝”，用户通过文字或语音指令即可直接唤醒点外卖、打车等生活服务，无需在菜单中查找。界面方面，底部核心位置由“资产”与“阿宝”模块占据，资产板块升级为卡片夹形式，直观展示理财与信用状况。为保障用户体验，新版支持双版本自主切换，默认保留原版界面。目前该项目处于极小范围灰度测试阶段，用户需通过特定邀请码激活，或尝试在搜索框输入“AI版支付宝”申请入口。此次重构是支付宝在超级App竞争中，针对金融账户与生活服务入口的战略布局，旨在通过AI原生界面提升用户交互效率。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">英伟达计划发行至少200亿美元债券以扩充AI算力基础设施</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/df6e2b264a845e8866cb9de8ca1699c7.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">英伟达于2026年6月15日宣布计划发行至少200亿美元债券，这是其自2021年以来首次重返债券市场，且融资规模显著提升。该笔债券将分七期发行，期限涵盖2年至30年，其中长债收益率较美国国债高出约0.9个百分点，由摩根大通、摩根士丹利及高盛担任承销商。英伟达表示，募集资金将用于一般公司用途及现有债务再融资。在当前全球科技巨头竞逐AI基础设施的背景下，英伟达此举旨在巩固现金流与财务防线，为高强度研发及供应链扩张储备资本。随着Alphabet、亚马逊等巨头纷纷通过债务市场筹集数千亿美元用于提升计算能力，英伟达的巨额融资标志着AI算力军备竞赛已从单纯的技术竞争，全面延伸至资本效率与债务杠杆的深度博弈，将进一步加剧全球算力基础设施的建设热潮。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">稀宇科技正式开源多模态旗舰模型 MiniMax M3，推理速度提升至 80 TPS</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/be3c1e6daf5cfdf2bb3780fa1e345b3d.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">稀宇科技今日正式开源其原生多模态旗舰大模型 MiniMax M3。该模型拥有 428B 总参数量，激活参数为 23B，是行业首个从底层训练初期即进行多模态混合训练的开源模型。发布两周内，M3 已登顶全球综合智能指数排行榜开源榜首。针对此前访问量激增导致的延迟问题，官方已将输出速度从 30 TPS 优化至 80 TPS。在技术能力方面，M3 在编码与智能体任务中表现突出，具备复杂任务拆解及多步推理能力。其代码生成能力旨在直接达到可交付标准，显著降低开发者的后期修改成本。此次开源及性能优化，标志着国产多模态大模型在架构设计与工程落地方面取得重要进展，将进一步推动开源社区在复杂任务处理与代码交付领域的应用实践。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">字节跳动拟向天数智芯采购5万颗AI芯片，加码国产算力布局</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/d920e5095af766f1e5bde33cf9dac4e4.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">字节跳动正与国内高性能计算厂商天数智芯深度洽谈，计划采购5万颗AI芯片，以强化算力基础设施的自主可控。该批芯片交付后将主要部署于推理任务场景，为字节跳动旗下AI聊天机器人“豆包”的持续迭代与用户增长提供算力支撑。若合作达成，天数智芯将成为继华为、寒武纪之后，字节跳动第三大国产GPU主力供应商。此举标志着天数智芯的产品在大规模集群部署能力上获得头部互联网厂商背书，同时也印证了国产GPU在高性能推理任务中的技术实力已达到商用落地标准。目前双方正就采购细节进行沟通，该动向反映出国内互联网大厂正加速构建以国产芯片为核心的算力体系，以应对日益复杂的AI应用需求。</section></section></section></section><section style=\"text-align:center;\"><img data-src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/xm1dT1jCe8lWwznuFM0USlcQ4HAb5iapyGyBVUyRZOyLbF3SaPphbdlF7K9R7YLicicIjdeAPueYcKHJDZEiceeUFQ/640?wx_fmt=png\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.4255555555555556\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"900\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/xm1dT1jCe8lWwznuFM0USlcQ4HAb5iapyGyBVUyRZOyLbF3SaPphbdlF7K9R7YLicicIjdeAPueYcKHJDZEiceeUFQ/640?wx_fmt=png\"></section>",
